 * Copyright (c) 2026 Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd.
 * Licensed under BSD-3.
 * AscendC AddLayerNorm kernel — one row at a time with minimal UB footprint.
 * Fuses: x_add = x1 + x2 (+ bias) → LayerNorm(x_add)
 * Supports: float32, float16, bfloat16
